675:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence
679:The corrections desk ships multiple notices per field. When several notices
680:target the same transaction and field, the notice with the lexicographically
681:greatest `effective` date wins. For each winning notice, `previous_value` in
682:`reconciliation_report.jsonl` is the field value immediately before that notice
683:applies (after ledger, amendments, and emails). Owner corrections override
